    {
        "title" : "OpenClaw: Exploration and Analysis",
        "date_published" : "2026-02-14T10:35:34+08:00",
        "date_modified" : "2026-02-14T10:35:34+08:00",
        "id" : "https://jerrysmd.github.io/20260214_openclaw-exploration/",
        "url" : "https://jerrysmd.github.io/20260214_openclaw-exploration/",
        "summary": "OpenClaw is an open-source, local-first AI automation agent platform. Its core goal is not \u0026ldquo;chatting\u0026rdquo; but \u0026ldquo;actually completing tasks\u0026rdquo;. By integrating LLM with multiple skills, it builds with persistent memory, proactive execution capabilities, and cross-platform collaboration, suitable for automation needs of individual users and small teams.\n",
        "content_html" : "\u003cp\u003eOpenClaw is an open-source, local-first AI automation agent platform. Its core goal is not \u0026ldquo;chatting\u0026rdquo; but \u0026ldquo;actually completing tasks\u0026rdquo;. By integrating LLM with multiple skills, it builds with persistent memory, proactive execution capabilities, and cross-platform collaboration, suitable for automation needs of individual users and small teams.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"introduction\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#introduction\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eIntroduction\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDifferent from traditional conversational AI, OpenClaw\u0026rsquo;s design philosophy is :\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTask-driven\u003c/strong\u003e: After receiving natural language instructions, it automatically decomposes tasks, calls tools, executes operations, and provides feedback on results.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow threshold\u003c/strong\u003e: No programming skills are required, users can directly use natural language to instruct the agent to complete tasks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh adaptability\u003c/strong\u003e: Can be used in various scenarios, such as web automation, data processing, document editing, etc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"operating-principle\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#operating-principle\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating Principle\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpenClaw is essentially a resident-running \u003cstrong\u003eGateway\u003c/strong\u003e: it routes messages from your messaging apps such as whatsapp, telegram, etc. to the AI agent.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBring AI capabilities down to your local environment, integrating messaging channels, file systems, terminals, browsers, and other execution surfaces through a unified gateway.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBypassing the traditional Saas, consolidating scattered automation into composable workflows.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"gateway-architecture\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#gateway-architecture\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eGateway Architecture\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-closed show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row\n    tw-flex-1 \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-flex\n        tw-flex-row\n        tw-flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90 tw-transition-[transform] tw-duration-500 tw-ease-in-out print:!tw-hidden tw-w-min tw-h-min tw-my-1 tw-mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003etext\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\n   \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M61.77 401l17.5-20.15a19.92 19.92 0 0 0 5.07-14.19v-3.31C84.34 356 80.5 352 73 352H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h22.83a157.41 157.41 0 0 0-11 12.31l-5.61 7c-4 5.07-5.25 10.13-2.8 14.88l1.05 1.93c3 5.76 6.29 7.88 12.25 7.88h4.73c10.33 0 15.94 2.44 15.94 9.09 0 4.72-4.2 8.22-14.36 8.22a41.54 41.54 0 0 1-15.47-3.12c-6.49-3.88-11.74-3.5-15.6 3.12l-5.59 9.31c-3.72 6.13-3.19 11.72 2.63 15.94 7.71 4.69 20.38 9.44 37 9.44 34.16 0 48.5-22.75 48.5-44.12-.03-14.38-9.12-29.76-28.73-34.88zM496 224H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0-160H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V80a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0 320H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zM16 160h64a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H64V40a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H32a8 8 0 0 0-7.14 4.42l-8 16A8 8 0 0 0 24 64h8v64H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8zm-3.91 160H80a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H41.32c3.29-10.29 48.34-18.68 48.34-56.44 0-29.06-25-39.56-44.47-39.56-21.36 0-33.8 10-40.46 18.75-4.37 5.59-3 10.84 2.8 15.37l8.58 6.88c5.61 4.56 11 2.47 16.12-2.44a13.44 13.44 0 0 1 9.46-3.84c3.33 0 9.28 1.56 9.28 8.75C51 248.19 0 257.31 0 304.59v4C0 316 5.08 320 12.09 320z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          wrap-code-button\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle code wrap\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M16 132h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16V76c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16C7.163 60 0 67.163 0 76v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n      \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          copy-code-button\n          tw-select-none\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden\n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block\n          hover:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\"\n        title=\"Copy code\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"copy-icon tw-block\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M433.941 65.941l-51.882-51.882A48 48 0 0 0 348.118 0H176c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v48H48c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v320c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h224c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48v-48h80c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V99.882a48 48 0 0 0-14.059-33.941zM266 464H54a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V150a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h74v224c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h96v42a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm128-96H182a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V54a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h106v88c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h88v202a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm6-256h-64V48h9.632c1.591 0 3.117.632 4.243 1.757l48.368 48.368a6 6 0 0 1 1.757 4.243V112z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"check-icon tw-hidden\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n        \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-block \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-hidden \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        disabled\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M328 256c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72 32.2-72 72-72 72 32.2 72 72zm104-72c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72zm-352 0c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw-block tw-m-0 tw-p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-17\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      !tw-block \n      tw-p-0\n      tw-m-0\n      tw-transition-[max-height] \n      tw-duration-500 \n      tw-ease-in-out \n      group-[.is-closed]:!tw-max-h-0 \n      group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-wrap\n      tw-overflow-y-hidden\n      tw-overflow-x-auto\n      tw-scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003eWhatsApp / Telegram / Slack / Discord / Google Chat / Signal / iMessage / BlueBubbles / Microsoft Teams / Matrix / Zalo / Zalo Personal / WebChat\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               │\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               ▼\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e┌───────────────────────────────┐\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e│            Gateway            │\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e│       (control plane)         │\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e│     ws://127.0.0.1:18789      │\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e└──────────────┬────────────────┘\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               │\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               ├─ Pi agent (RPC)\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               ├─ CLI (openclaw …)\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               ├─ WebChat UI\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               ├─ macOS app\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e               └─ iOS / Android nodes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"openclaw-scenarios\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#openclaw-scenarios\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOpenClaw Scenarios\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"scenario-1-corporate-homepage-creation\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#scenario-1-corporate-homepage-creation\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScenario 1: Corporate Homepage Creation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026ldquo;Give me a homepage HTML for a company\u0026rdquo;\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw write skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026ldquo;Give me a URL for previewing the homepage\u0026rdquo;\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw process/exec skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026ldquo;The port 80 is not safe, change to 18888\u0026rdquo;\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw exec skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"tw-inline\" loading=\"lazy\" src='/20260214_openclaw-exploration/image-20260214112116183.png' srcset=\"/20260214_openclaw-exploration/image-20260214112116183_hu_3e04ed7c51fafdfd.webp 800w, /20260214_openclaw-exploration/image-20260214112116183_hu_2b1c7e471874c5bc.webp 1200w, /20260214_openclaw-exploration/image-20260214112116183_hu_5731fcbae96f5c44.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"image-20260214112116183\" height=\"865\" width=\"1574\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"scenario-2-scheduled-task-execution\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#scenario-2-scheduled-task-execution\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScenario 2: Scheduled Task Execution\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026ldquo;remind me to workout in 30 minutes\u0026rdquo;\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw cron skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"tw-inline\" loading=\"lazy\" src='/20260214_openclaw-exploration/G-eZ-kMacAAdOkM.jpeg' srcset=\"/20260214_openclaw-exploration/G-eZ-kMacAAdOkM_hu_260c030db24e48fc.webp 800w, /20260214_openclaw-exploration/G-eZ-kMacAAdOkM_hu_660f0db0412309cd.webp 1200w, /20260214_openclaw-exploration/G-eZ-kMacAAdOkM_hu_eb339a27e4c0ae30.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"kMacAAdOkM\" height=\"1980\" width=\"2898\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"scenario-3-querying-github-trending-charts\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#scenario-3-querying-github-trending-charts\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScenario 3: Querying GitHub Trending Charts\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026ldquo;What are the trending on social medias today?\u0026rdquo;\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw http request skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"tw-inline\" loading=\"lazy\" src='/20260214_openclaw-exploration/855c73713bc98995b4cbfeac715ddfb6.png' srcset=\"/20260214_openclaw-exploration/855c73713bc98995b4cbfeac715ddfb6_hu_44bbf44ea7012098.webp 800w, /20260214_openclaw-exploration/855c73713bc98995b4cbfeac715ddfb6_hu_6c5acd976e823716.webp 1200w, /20260214_openclaw-exploration/855c73713bc98995b4cbfeac715ddfb6_hu_11669978bf32ec23.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"image\" height=\"1703\" width=\"3688\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"scenario-4-download-papers\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#scenario-4-download-papers\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScenario 4: Download Papers\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026ldquo;Have it help me download a paper I saw earlier to my local machine\u0026rdquo;\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw file system skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw http request skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"scenario-5-install-skills\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#scenario-5-install-skills\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScenario 5: Install Skills\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe cursor has already been installed on the remote computer. First, let Openclaw install the \u003cstrong\u003ecursor-agent\u003c/strong\u003e skills, then write the corporate promotion interface, and finally optimize the interface using ui-ux-pro-max skills.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw skill installation\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw write skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw ui-ux-pro-max skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw install ui-ux-pro-max skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"scenario-6-excel-operations\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#scenario-6-excel-operations\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScenario 6: Excel Operations\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUsing chat to install the excel skills recommended by anthropic offical.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw Cursor CLI installation\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw XLSX/SKILL.md/Python pandas openpyxl skills installation\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRequesting aggregate documents\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eopenclaw read skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOptimization results\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"scenario-7-cowork-legal-plugins\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#scenario-7-cowork-legal-plugins\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScenario 7: Cowork legal plugins\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eask: Analyze whether this plugin can be install\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdopt Plan A to adapt all commands and skills\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003esuccessfully install 7 skills, while consuming 24% of context\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTest review skills\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"openclaw-core-file\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#openclaw-core-file\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOpenClaw Core File\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe following core file exist in the \u003ccode\u003e/home/admin/clawd\u003c/code\u003e foldr:\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"agentsmd\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#agentsmd\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAGENTS.md\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eAGENTS.md\u003c/code\u003e is not originally created by OpenClaw, but rather an open standard adopted and integrated from the broader AI programming agent community. It serves as a comprehensive documentation file that outlines the various agents, their capabilities, and how they interact within the OpenClaw ecosystem. This file is crucial for developers and users to understand the functionalities of different agents and how to utilize them effectively in their automation tasks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-closed show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row\n    tw-flex-1 \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-flex\n        tw-flex-row\n        tw-flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90 tw-transition-[transform] tw-duration-500 tw-ease-in-out print:!tw-hidden tw-w-min tw-h-min tw-my-1 tw-mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003emarkdown\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n