        "summary": "Apache Spark™ is a multi-language engine for executing data engineering, data science, and machine learning on single-node machines or clusters.\n",
        "content_html" : "\u003cp\u003eApache Spark™ is a multi-language engine for executing data engineering, data science, and machine learning on single-node machines or clusters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"details admonition note open\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-summary admonition-title\"\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"icon\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M497.9 142.1l-46.1 46.1c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0l-111-111c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l46.1-46.1c18.7-18.7 49.1-18.7 67.9 0l60.1 60.1c18.8 18.7 18.8 49.1 0 67.9zM284.2 99.8L21.6 362.4.4 483.9c-2.9 16.4 11.4 30.6 27.8 27.8l121.5-21.3 262.6-262.6c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.3 0-17l-111-111c-4.8-4.7-12.4-4.7-17.1 0zM124.1 339.9c-5.5-5.5-5.5-14.3 0-19.8l154-154c5.5-5.5 14.3-5.5 19.8 0s5.5 14.3 0 19.8l-154 154c-5.5 5.5-14.3 5.5-19.8 0zM88 424h48v36.3l-64.5 11.3-31.1-31.1L51.7 376H88v48z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003eNote\u003cspan class=\"details-icon\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-content\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"admonition-content\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis is my \u003cmark\u003eKnowledge Transfer\u003c/mark\u003e about \u003cstrong\u003eHow to get start with Spark Java development\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd this is my slide:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"1spark-简介\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#1spark-%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1.Spark 简介\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"1-spark-的背景\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#1-spark-%e7%9a%84%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1. Spark 的背景\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230102224511013.png' srcset=\"/20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230102224511013_hu_af454c290db0bcd3.webp 800w, /20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230102224511013_hu_ffd87c6654a54099.webp 1200w, /20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230102224511013_hu_c4d8a83ce846a95f.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"image-20230102224511013\" height=\"316\" width=\"1640\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/20221231_spark-sharing/image-20221228141948679.png' srcset=\"/20221231_spark-sharing/image-20221228141948679_hu_8c5de08b798a3564.webp 800w, /20221231_spark-sharing/image-20221228141948679_hu_999a00a8147278e.webp 1200w, /20221231_spark-sharing/image-20221228141948679_hu_e237b31bb98ba3f1.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"image-20221228141948679\" height=\"191\" width=\"1468\"\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230103022138334.png' srcset=\"/20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230103022138334_hu_eb15a618e5e4153c.webp 800w, /20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230103022138334_hu_892859cb18e2cb2a.webp 1200w, /20221231_spark-sharing/image-20230103022138334_hu_4836cde27a38938c.webp 1600w\"  alt=\"image-20230103022138334\" height=\"207\" width=\"146