    {
        "title" : "C Project Performance Tuning",
        "date_published" : "2019-04-09T20:04:00+08:00",
        "date_modified" : "2019-04-09T20:04:00+08:00",
        "id" : "https://jerrysmd.github.io/20190409_cperformance-optimization/",
        "url" : "https://jerrysmd.github.io/20190409_cperformance-optimization/",
        "summary": "Performance optimization methods and ideas for large C projects. Performance optimization strategies for x86 projects that encounter performance bottlenecks when porting to low performance processors.\n",
        "content_html" : "\u003cp\u003ePerformance optimization methods and ideas for large C projects. Performance optimization strategies for x86 projects that encounter performance bottlenecks when porting to low performance processors.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"通常优化方法\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e9%80%9a%e5%b8%b8%e4%bc%98%e5%8c%96%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e通常优化方法\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"1-宏定义或内联\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#1-%e5%ae%8f%e5%ae%9a%e4%b9%89%e6%88%96%e5%86%85%e8%81%94\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1. 宏定义或内联\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e短的、调用频繁的函数改为宏定义或内联函数，减少调用层级\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e可能编译器已经做了部分优化，效果不一定明显\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"2-固定次数的短循环展开\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#2-%e5%9b%ba%e5%ae%9a%e6%ac%a1%e6%95%b0%e7%9a%84%e7%9f%ad%e5%be%aa%e7%8e%af%e5%b1%95%e5%bc%80\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2. 固定次数的短循环展开\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e循环语句如果循环次数已知，且是短循环，可以将语句展开\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e编译器可能已做优化，效果不一定明显\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"3-减少内存分配和释放的次数\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#3-%e5%87%8f%e5%b0%91%e5%86%85%e5%ad%98%e5%88%86%e9%85%8d%e5%92%8c%e9%87%8a%e6%94%be%e7%9a%84%e6%ac%a1%e6%95%b0\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e3. 减少内存分配和释放的次数\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e频繁使用的变量能用全局变量的尽量不用局部变量\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e函数体内部的局部变量，如果大小不是特别大，尽量不用动态分配空间\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e数据结构中，尽量不用指针变量\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"4-移位代替乘除\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#4-%e7%a7%bb%e4%bd%8d%e4%bb%a3%e6%9b%bf%e4%b9%98%e9%99%a4\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e4. 移位代替乘除\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"5-条件语句优化\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#5-%e6%9d%a1%e4%bb%b6%e8%af%ad%e5%8f%a5%e4%bc%98%e5%8c%96\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e5. 条件语句优化\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e根据分支被执行的频率将频繁执行的分支放在前面部分\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"6-数据结构算法\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#6-%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84%e7%ae%97%e6%b3%95\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e6. 数据结构/算法\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e数据结构中尽量减少需要动态分配空间的指针，改用联合、结构体或固定大小的缓存区\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"7-使用并行程序\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#7-%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e5%b9%b6%e8%a1%8c%e7%a8%8b%e5%ba%8f\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e7. 使用并行程序\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch2 id=\"代码重构原则\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e4%bb%a3%e7%a0%81%e9%87%8d%e6%9e%84%e5%8e%9f%e5%88%99\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e代码重构原则\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e维护一套代码，使用宏定义控制\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e小步前进，重构一部分进行充分测试后再重构下一部分\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
        "language": "en"
    },
    {
        "title" : "GDB debug guide",
        "date_published" : "2019-03-04T00:00:00Z",
        "date_modified" : "2019-03-04T00:00:00Z",
        "id" : "https://jerrysmd.github.io/20190304_gdb-debug/",
        "url" : "https://jerrysmd.github.io/20190304_gdb-debug/",
        "summary": "GDB is a powerful program debugging tool based on command line under UNIX/LINUX operating system released by GNU Source Organization. For a C/C ++ programmer working on Linux, GDB is an essential tool.\n",
        "content_html" : "\u003cp\u003eGDB is a powerful program debugging tool based on command line under UNIX/LINUX operating system released by GNU Source Organization. For a C/C ++ programmer working on Linux, GDB is an essential tool.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"gdb的使用\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#gdb%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003egdb的使用\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"启动gdb\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%90%af%e5%8a%a8gdb\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e启动gdb\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e编译一个测试程序，-g表示可以调试\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row\n    tw-flex-1 \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-flex\n        tw-flex-row\n        tw-flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90 tw-transition-[transform] tw-duration-500 tw-ease-in-out print:!tw-hidden tw-w-min tw-h-min tw-my-1 tw-mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003eshell\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\n   \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u00